## Quay

@mara{code="0010" when="has(prev.run.route) && prev.run.route != 'none'"}: Back again, I see.
@mara{code="0020"}: The bell is ringing.
::set{user.runs += 1}
<branch id="path" prompt="Where now?">
  <choice id="dock" text="Walk to the dock">
    ::set{run.route = "dock"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="hill" text="Climb the hill">
    ::set{run.route = "hill"}
  </choice>
</branch>
@mara{code="0040"}: Mind the tide.
@narrator{code="0030"}: The tide goes out.
::set{run.over = true}
